    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 03</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Multi‑ply corrugated sheetsThree layers of heavy‑duty corrugated cardboard form a rigid shell around the wrapped items. The corrugation adds structural strength, preventing flexing of the inner layers and shielding against punctures.</p>
