    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 04</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Stretch filmA tight, transparent stretch film encases the corrugated bundle, securing all previous layers together. It creates a uniform tension that resists shifting, moisture, and dust, while also providing a visual cue that the package is sealed.</p>
