    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 05</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Custom wooden cratesFor the most valuable or unusually shaped objects, Shree Ashirwad fabricates bespoke wooden crates. These crates act as a final, rigid fortress, distributing weight evenly and protecting against external impacts during loading and unloading.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<p>By integrating these five components into a cohesive 7‑layer system, Shree Ashirwad guarantees that every fragile item arrives in Noida‑to‑Lucknow moves as pristine as when it left. The layered approach not only minimizes damage risk but also offers peace of mind to customers who trust the company with their most treasured possessions.</p></div>
