<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Noida To Lucknow Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I choose the right packers and movers for a Noida to Lucknow relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Select a mover with IBA approval, ISO‑9001 certification, and a proven track record on the Noida‑Lucknow corridor. Verify fleet ownership, GPS tracking, and 100 % insurance coverage. Read recent customer reviews, compare transparent cost matrices, and confirm they handle all required documentation for intercity moves.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity move from Noida to Lucknow?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid ID proof, address proof for both origin and destination, GSTIN (if applicable), and a signed packing list. For corporate or government transfers, include the e‑Way bill and any reimbursement claim forms. Shree Ashirwad assists in preparing all paperwork to avoid delays at checkpoints.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my goods insurance handled during the Noida‑Lucknow transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad provides IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % of the declared value. The policy is activated at pick‑up, and a claim can be filed within 30 days of delivery. Insurance details are included in the invoice, and the mover assists with claim documentation if needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a Noida to Lucknow move via NH‑19?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the 516 km journey on NH‑19 takes approximately 10‑12 hours of driving time. Including loading, unloading, and checkpoint clearances, most residential moves are completed within 1‑2 days. Shree Ashirwad’s live GPS tracking lets you monitor progress in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special restrictions or prohibited items for Noida‑Lucknow moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Hazardous materials such as flammable liquids, explosives, and chemicals are prohibited. Perishable food, live animals, and high‑value cash should be handled separately. The mover will provide a detailed list of restricted items during the pre‑move survey to ensure compliance with transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect my fragile items on the Noida‑Lucknow route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each layer adds a specific protection: bubble wrap cushions impact, foam guards edges, corrugated sheets absorb shocks, stretch film shields against moisture, and custom wooden crates provide structural rigidity. This multi‑layer approach mitigates vibrations and bumps common on long highway trips, ensuring items arrive intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live during the Noida to Lucknow relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All Shree Ashirwad container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS devices. Once the shipment is en‑route, you receive a tracking link that shows real‑time location, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint stops, giving you full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
